{
  "bookId": "hero-213017",
  "id": "bond-33401",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33401001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "您来了，我记得主君的脚步声。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33401003",
              "text": "你这是……？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33401003",
              "text": "轻小说和流行乐……？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33401002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君的眼神好生奇怪，这有什么不妥吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只是好奇。你也喜欢这些吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君说笑了，不论是谁，都会为精彩的故事着迷呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "还有这些乐曲，曲调独特，音色迥异，也不知道用了什么奇特的乐器。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个是电吉他，摇滚乐里比较常见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "「摇滚乐」是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个说来话长……总之它是一种象征反抗与自由的音乐！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "原来如此！那已经有手办教过我「摇滚乐」了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "诶？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "首先是开场白——「咳咳，耐震强度没有问题，要跟着旋律一起摇摆哦！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "接着是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33401014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "慢着慢着，这是谁教你的……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
